<h1>. . Docs In Progress . .</h1>

<p>This is the official documentation site for the Blazor Ramp Opensource Project</p>
<p>
    For those wandering about the colours, the difference between this site and the <a class="link" target="_blank" href="https://blazorramp.uk">test site (opens in new window)</a> is a single css property value.
    I overrode the primary colour variable that's contained in the Core project to Sienna - job done.
</p>
<p>
    I thought I would deploy the site after doing any work on it so you can keep track of its progress, <b>warts and all</b>.
</p>
<p>
   Let me know any issues you spot and/or have with it so I can fix things now whilst its easier to do so.
</p>
<p>
    Thanks for your patience.
    <br />
    <br />
    Paul
</p>
